# Probe 4: the Install-Application dialog (ADINSAPP). Selects C:\CMDLINE.NCP in
# the C:\ window (which is what enables the menu entry, `men_update`), opens
# Options -> Install application... and lets `probe_tree` dump every object's
# absolute rectangle -- where DESK20's function-key click point comes from.
#   C:\ window CMDLINE.NCP (347,145)                            [probe run 1]
#   Options title hover (196,9), `Install application...` (280,43)  [probe 1]
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 key 38
1550 key 2e
1600 key ae
1650 key b8
2800 mark B_WIN
3100 move 347 145
3400 down
3403 up
3800 parkbr
4600 mark C_SEL
4900 move 196 240
5300 move 196 9
5900 mark D_MENU
6100 move 280 43
6500 down
6503 up
7100 parkbr
8000 mark E_INSAPP
9600 pause
